    {q: "Where do I set the anamorphic ratio in DaVinci Resolve?", a: "In the clip's Camera Raw panel (for supported raw formats) or the Clip Attributes panel, there's an anamorphic ratio setting where you enter your lens's exact squeeze factor so Resolve can desqueeze the footage back to correct proportions."},
